WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Less than one kilometer, a few minutes' drive and not far to walk. No one lives on the 16th floor. There should be no one at the moment.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,800
The landlord on the 14th floor is a local and the house has been rented out.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,100
The landlord on the 15th floor is abroad and wants to get rich in half a year

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,900
I have to go back and check if the 16th floor has been sold.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,300
There is no one upstairs. I have never lived on the 15th floor. The landlord is still abroad.

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,200
In the future, I will have to renovate the doors and windows and move a lot of stuff, so it won’t be easy to be discovered.

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,800
No need to look at anything else. This is 1502.

8
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,900
Contact the landlord. I will sign the contract at any time.

9
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,100
And my two apartments, please help me expedite them.

10
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,000
Sister, don’t worry. I will give you a key recommendation today and I will definitely take action as soon as possible.

11
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,700
At half past three, it’s time to meet Mo Mo

12
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,360
People are not as tall as my legs, and they have a lot of peach blossoms.

13
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,380
Okay, let’s go home and have a big dinner

14
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:43,180
Is there meat in the dinner?

15
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,180
Yes, and many are good

16
00:00:46,330 --> 00:00:48,130
I’m going to the wholesale market later to purchase in bulk.

17
00:00:48,530 --> 00:00:50,330
It's impossible to run around in crowds of people with Mo Mo every day
